  "intro": "This two-year Engineering Doctorate develops repeatable fieldwork and data-management procedures for underground utility mapping. The work centres on ground-penetrating radar at Twente’s Utility Mapping Site.",
  "description": "<h2>Project Overview</h2>\n<p>This two-year Engineering Doctorate develops repeatable fieldwork and data-management procedures for underground utility mapping. The work centres on ground-penetrating radar at Twente’s Utility Mapping Site.</p>\n\n<h2>Research Position Overview</h2>\n<p>Define measurement protocols and metadata, run repeated field campaigns and assemble a benchmark dataset for comparing radar systems. Translate findings into practical guidance for industry partners.</p>\n\n<h2>Research Areas</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ground-penetrating radar</li>\n<li>Utility mapping and geomatics</li>\n<li>Field-data standards</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Funding and Duration</h2>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:18px 0;\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\">\n<caption style=\"text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-bottom:8px;\">Employment and financial support</caption>\n<thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#eaf1f7;\">Component</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#eaf1f7;\">Details</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Position</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">EngD employee</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Salary</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">€3,173 gross/month.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Duration</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Two years, full-time; 40% education and 60% design project.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Benefits</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">8% holiday allowance, 8.3% year-end bonus and employee benefits.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Programme / host support</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">ZoARG programme; salaried EngD employment.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n<h2>Eligibility and Requirements</h2>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:18px 0;\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\">\n<caption style=\"text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-bottom:8px;\">Academic preparation and skills</caption>\n<thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#eaf1f7;\">Component</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#eaf1f7;\">Details</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Applicant eligibility</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Worldwide, subject to the official qualifications and recruitment checks.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Academic preparation</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Master’s or equivalent experience in civil engineering, geomatics, geoinformation, spatial engineering or a related area.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Research skills</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">GIS/surveying or spatial data processing; interest in fieldwork and reproducible measurements.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Language</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">English proficiency required; the advert does not specify IELTS as mandatory.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n<h2>Application Dates</h2>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:18px 0;\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\">\n<caption style=\"text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-bottom:8px;\">Recruitment dates and location</caption>\n<thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#eaf1f7;\">Component</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#eaf1f7;\">Details</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Recruitment status</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Open when verified against the official source</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Deadline</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">27 November 2026.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Start date</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">First half of 2027.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:29%;\">Location</th><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d5dde5;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Enschede, Netherlands</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n<h2>How to Apply</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Recent CV and motivation letter: maximum 1.5 pages.</li>\n<li>MSc overview including thesis title, abstract and grades.</li>\n</ul><p>Submit through the application button on the official recruitment page.</p>\n\n<h2>Selection and Contact</h2>\n<p>Interviews are scheduled for 11 and 18 December 2026. This is an EngD, not a research PhD.</p><p>Project contact: Léon Olde Scholtenhuis or Rik ter Huurne.</p>\n\n<h2>About University of Twente</h2>\n<p>The project brings together Civil Engineering and Management, Applied Earth Sciences and industrial partners through the ZoARG programme.</p>\n\n<h2>Official Source</h2>\n<p>Vacancy details verified against the official source. The employer’s notice governs recruitment terms.</p><p><a href=\"https://utwentecareers.nl/en/vacancies/2601/engd-position-standardizing-fieldwork-and-data-management-for-utility-mapping/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read the official vacancy and apply</a></p><h2>Application guides</h2><ul><li><a href=\"https://nextapply.co.uk/articles/how-to-email-phd-supervisor-uk-7-templates\">How to Email a PhD Supervisor: 7 Templates and Practical Tips</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nextapply.co.uk/articles/how-to-read-phd-job-advertisement-before-applying\">How to Read a PhD Job Advert: Funding, Eligibility and Application Steps</a></li></ul>",
